<Pathway Data-Source="WikiPathways" Last-Modified="20260821200526" Author="[marvinm2]" Version="WP5427_r20260821200526" xmlns="http://pathvisio.org/GPML/2013a" Name="EGF receptor to RAS browser test" Organism="Homo sapiens">
  <Graphics BoardWidth="760.0" BoardHeight="680.0" />
  <Comment Source="WikiPathways-description">Epidermal growth factor binds the EGF receptor, which recruits the adaptor GRB2 and the guanine nucleotide exchange factor SOS1 and thereby loads KRAS with GTP, initiating downstream proliferative signalling in human cells.</Comment>
